    "slug": "rich-vibes",
    "name": "Rich Vibes",
    "parent_slug": "collections",
    "description": "<div class=\"text\">\n<h2 data-end=\"112\" data-start=\"84\">Rich Vibes by Be Trendy</h2>\n<p data-end=\"352\" data-start=\"114\"><strong data-end=\"227\" data-start=\"114\">Rich Vibes is a body care collection for those who love to feel nourished, glowing, and absolutely luxurious.</strong><br data-end=\"230\" data-start=\"227\"/>\r\nWe’ve blended rich textures, precious oils, and indulgent scents to transform everyday self-care into a spa-like ritual.</p>\n<p data-end=\"387\" data-start=\"354\">In this collection you’ll find:</p>\n<ul data-end=\"674\" data-start=\"388\">\n<li data-end=\"474\" data-start=\"388\">\n<p data-end=\"474\" data-start=\"390\"><strong data-end=\"406\" data-start=\"390\">Body butters</strong> with shea butter that deeply nourish and leave skin silky smooth.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"567\" data-start=\"475\">\n<p data-end=\"567\" data-start=\"477\"><strong data-end=\"500\" data-start=\"477\">Salt &amp; sugar scrubs</strong> that gently exfoliate while giving you that at-home spa feeling.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"674\" data-start=\"568\">\n<p data-end=\"674\" data-start=\"570\"><strong data-end=\"600\" data-start=\"570\">Shimmer lotions and creams</strong> that add a subtle glow and create the look of perfectly cared-for skin.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"855\" data-start=\"676\">Rich Vibes is made for those who want more than just basic care. It’s your way to bring a touch of <strong data-end=\"828\" data-start=\"775\">luxury, soft textures, and irresistible fragrance</strong> into your daily routine.</p>\n<h3 data-end=\"885\" data-start=\"857\">Why choose Rich Vibes?</h3>\n<ul data-end=\"1030\" data-start=\"886\">\n<li data-end=\"937\" data-start=\"886\">\n<p data-end=\"937\" data-start=\"888\"><strong data-end=\"909\" data-start=\"888\">On-trend formulas</strong> with trusted ingredients.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"986\" data-start=\"938\">\n<p data-end=\"986\" data-start=\"940\"><strong data-end=\"984\" data-start=\"940\">Visible results from the very first use.</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-end=\"1030\" data-start=\"987\">\n<p data-end=\"1030\" data-start=\"989\"><strong data-end=\"1028\" data-start=\"989\">Stylish design that fits your vibe.</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-end=\"1095\" data-start=\"1032\">Unlock your energy of luxury with Be Trendy — <strong data-end=\"1092\" data-start=\"1078\">Rich Vibes</strong>.</p>\n </div>",
    "source_url": "https://betrendy.space/en/rich-vibes/"
